---
title: Best Anytime Baked Chicken Meatballs
source: https://pinchofyum.com/best-anytime-baked-chicken-meatballs
servings: 4
tags: [quick, freezer]
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 25 minutes
---

> Makes 25–30 small meatballs. Ground turkey works in place of the chicken.

Heat the oven to 400°F. Line a #baking sheet{} with foil and a little cooking spray.

In a #mixing bowl{}, mix @ground chicken{1%lb}, @egg{1}, @panko breadcrumbs{1/2%cup}, @parmesan{1/2%cup}(grated), @?olive oil{2%tbsp}(makes them more moist), @garlic powder{1/2%tsp}, @onion powder{1/2%tsp}, @salt{1/2%tsp} and @black pepper{}(to taste). Add any other seasonings you like.

Roll the mixture into about 30 small balls and set them on the baking sheet.

Bake for ~{25%minutes} (25–30), until cooked through.
